 here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 that pair landed at 58% of normal on the middle, and November to December at 44%. September to October is the driest pair at 6.84 inches of normal, March to April the wettest at 11.60. Every grid had its driest year in 1952, with grid 15163 at 62%.</p>"}
